workedExample:
Insert into the lower half when the new value is no larger than that half’s maximum; otherwise insert into the upper half. Rebalance sizes afterward.

```
5:  lo{5}        hi{}
15: lo{5}        hi{15}
1:  lo{1,5}      hi{15}
3:  lo{1,3,5} -> too big, move 5
    lo{1,3}      hi{5,15}
8:  8 > 3: hi{5,8,15} -> move 5
    lo{1,3,5}    hi{8,15}
```

The lower-heap root is five, so the median is five. With n values inserted so far, each insertion is O(log n) and reading the median is O(1).
